			"frameId": null,
			"index": "b18",
			"roundness": null,
			"seed": 336465284,
			"version": 1550,
			"versionNonce": 1634446524,
			"isDeleted": false,
			"boundElements": [],
			"updated": 1783545802171,
			"locked": false,
			"text": "Summary of what you just learned:\n1. Nodes use ArrayList to keep their children flexible.\n2. Insertion is just adding to a list.\n3. Searching is brute-force recursion (you can't optimize because there is no order).\n4. DFS uses the Call Stack (via recursion) to dive deep.\n5. BFS uses an explicit Queue to explore layer by layer.",
			"rawText": "Summary of what you just learned:\n1. Nodes use ArrayList to keep their children flexible.\n2. Insertion is just adding to a list.\n3. Searching is brute-force recursion (you can't optimize because there is no order).\n4. DFS uses the Call Stack (via recursion) to dive deep.\n5. BFS uses an explicit Queue to explore layer by layer.",
			"fontSize": 20,
			"fontFamily": 8,
			"textAlign": "left",
			"verticalAlign": "top",
			"containerId": "ROhOezdI",
			"originalText": "Summary of what you just learned:\n1. Nodes use ArrayList to keep their children flexible.\n2. Insertion is just adding to a list.\n3. Searching is brute-force recursion (you can't optimize because there is no order).\n4. DFS uses the Call Stack (via recursion) to dive deep.\n5. BFS uses an explicit Queue to explore layer by layer.",
			"autoResize": true,
			"lineHeight": 1.25,
			"hasTextLink": false,
			"link": null
		},
