			"isDeleted": false,
			"boundElements": [],
			"updated": 1783545802171,
			"locked": false,
			"text": "Time Complexity: O(N)\nSpace Complexity: O(W)\nExplanation: You visit every node exactly once. Space complexity is tied to the Maximum\nWidth (W) of the tree, as the Queue must hold all nodes present at the current level.",
			"rawText": "Time Complexity: O(N)\nSpace Complexity: O(W)\nExplanation: You visit every node exactly once. Space complexity is tied to the Maximum Width (W) of the tree, as the Queue must hold all nodes present at the current level.",
			"fontSize": 20,
			"fontFamily": 8,
			"textAlign": "left",
			"verticalAlign": "top",
			"containerId": "LAORbbJY",
			"originalText": "Time Complexity: O(N)\nSpace Complexity: O(W)\nExplanation: You visit every node exactly once. Space complexity is tied to the Maximum Width (W) of the tree, as the Queue must hold all nodes present at the current level.",
			"autoResize": true,
			"lineHeight": 1.25,
