			"text": "Time Complexity: O(N)\nSpace Complexity: O(1) (Iterative) or O(H) (Recursive stack)\nExplanation: Because a General Tree is unordered, there is no \"shortcut\" to find a node.\nYou must perform an exhaustive scan of the entire structure. In the worst-case scenario,\nthe target node is the very last leaf visited.",
			"rawText": "Time Complexity: O(N)\nSpace Complexity: O(1) (Iterative) or O(H) (Recursive stack)\nExplanation: Because a General Tree is unordered, there is no \"shortcut\" to find a node. You must perform an exhaustive scan of the entire structure. In the worst-case scenario, the target node is the very last leaf visited.",
