			"seed": 1721446844,
			"version": 653,
			"versionNonce": 1893470212,
			"isDeleted": false,
			"boundElements": [],
			"updated": 1783554828647,
			"locked": false,
			"text": "Time Complexity: O(H) — Averages O(log N), Worst-case O(N).\nSpace Complexity: O(H) (Recursive stack).\nExplanation: Insertion is just a Search that fails. We follow the BST rules downward\nuntil we hit a null pointer, and we attach the new node exactly at that empty spot.",
			"rawText": "Time Complexity: O(H) — Averages O(log N), Worst-case O(N).\nSpace Complexity: O(H) (Recursive stack).\nExplanation: Insertion is just a Search that fails. We follow the BST rules downward until we hit a null pointer, and we attach the new node exactly at that empty spot.",
			"fontSize": 20,
			"fontFamily": 8,
			"textAlign": "left",
			"verticalAlign": "top",
			"containerId": "Y1K5dCJZ8k4j1Xowqreph",
			"originalText": "Time Complexity: O(H) — Averages O(log N), Worst-case O(N).\nSpace Complexity: O(H) (Recursive stack).\nExplanation: Insertion is just a Search that fails. We follow the BST rules downward until we hit a null pointer, and we attach the new node exactly at that empty spot.",
			"autoResize": true,
			"lineHeight": 1.25,
			"hasTextLink": false,
			"link": null
		},
