		{
			"id": "hSPmec9p",
			"type": "text",
			"x": 3891.8423484565287,
			"y": 2410.736726948925,
			"width": 1000.9986572265625,
			"height": 125,
			"angle": 0,
			"strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
			"backgroundColor": "transparent",
			"fillStyle": "solid",
			"strokeWidth": 1,
			"strokeStyle": "dashed",
			"roughness": 0,
			"opacity": 100,
			"groupIds": [],
			"frameId": null,
			"index": "b4R",
			"roundness": null,
			"seed": 1953593092,
			"version": 491,
			"versionNonce": 800951684,
			"isDeleted": false,
			"boundElements": [],
			"updated": 1783554828647,
			"locked": false,
			"text": "Explanation: Deletion requires finding the node, then patching the hole it leaves.\n  - Case 1 (Leaf): Just delete it (return null).\n  - Case 2 (One Child): Bypass the node (return its only child).\n  - Case 3 (Two Children): Find the \"In-Order Successor\" (the smallest value in the right \n    subtree), copy its value to the target node, and then recursively delete the successor.",
			"rawText": "Explanation: Deletion requires finding the node, then patching the hole it leaves.\n  - Case 1 (Leaf): Just delete it (return null).\n  - Case 2 (One Child): Bypass the node (return its only child).\n  - Case 3 (Two Children): Find the \"In-Order Successor\" (the smallest value in the right \n    subtree), copy its value to the target node, and then recursively delete the successor.",
			"fontSize": 20,
			"fontFamily": 8,
			"textAlign": "left",
			"verticalAlign": "top",
			"containerId": "ZPMmG7zrDbB0hR6auB_hm",
			"originalText": "Explanation: Deletion requires finding the node, then patching the hole it leaves.\n  - Case 1 (Leaf): Just delete it (return null).\n  - Case 2 (One Child): Bypass the node (return its only child).\n  - Case 3 (Two Children): Find the \"In-Order Successor\" (the smallest value in the right \n    subtree), copy its value to the target node, and then recursively delete the successor.",
			"autoResize": true,
			"lineHeight": 1.25,
			"hasTextLink": false,
			"link": null
		},
